{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121835","id":4146030382,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc73H2cu","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121835","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121835.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121835.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121835","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121835/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121835/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121835/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/b854ecd681b13edb390c59aaa14b8465c254f0b6","number":121835,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"renderer: Improve SPIR-V reflection performance","user":{"login":"stuartcarnie","id":52852,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52852?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie","html_url":"https://github.com/stuartcarnie","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"The problem was `FindNode` was performing a linear scan, so the lookup became $$O(N²)$$. It is now $$O(1)$$.\r\n\r\nThe following table shows the total CPU time (in seconds) of the `reflect_spirv` function:\r\n\r\n| Before | After |\r\n| :---- | :---- |\r\n| <img width=\"2808\" height=\"1800\" alt=\"CleanShot 2026-07-28 at 14 40 28@2x\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/734a0d05-aaf8-4225-af05-ce3fbdfab60c\" /> | <img width=\"2804\" height=\"1810\" alt=\"CleanShot 2026-07-28 at 14 40 53@2x\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9bcf75dc-6adb-4fc8-925e-b681caa672c4\" /> |\r\n\r\n **TL;DR**\r\n\r\n7.24 s down to 544 ms and improves _all_ platforms.\r\n\r\n> [!NOTE]\r\n>\r\n> We should submit a patch to https://github.com/KhronosGroup/SPIRV-Reflect\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>🤖 AI Disclosure</summary>\r\n\r\nI worked with AI to identify the root cause and used it to help write a solution. I benchmarked and fed the data to the agent. I understand the code and the changes and have validated it.\r\n\r\n</details>","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","description":"","color":"447777","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/2